  "body": "### Cline Surface\n\nDesktop App\n\n### Cline Version\n\n0.0.49\n\n### Beta version\n\n- [ ] I am using a beta version of Cline\n\n### What happened?\n\nThe ⌘ + , keyboard shortcut is not opening the Settings page in Cline Desktop, even though it is displayed as the assigned shortcut.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open Cline Desktop.\n2. Navigate to Settings → Keybindings.\n3. Verify that the shortcut for Open settings is ⌘ + ,.\n4. Press ⌘ + ,.\n\n### Observed:\nSettings does not open when the keyboard shortcut is pressed.\n\n### Expected:\nSettings should open when the user presses ⌘ + ,\n\n### Video Link: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CbO-ZC-YH5AMn_Jq_3MglzgOuNtGFMaU/view?usp=sharing\n\n\n### Provider/Model\n\nanthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5\n\n### Diagnostics\n\n_No response_\n\n### System Information\n\n0.0.49",
